  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p><strong>Sep 1 2026 refresh.</strong> Cars.com: 24 raw cards (2 pages) \u2192 15 excluded (2-seat deny-list + personal exclude list) \u2192 16 retained. CarGurus: 21 cards \u2192 5 excluded \u2192 13 retained. AutoTrader: 37 inventory items \u2192 11 retained after body-style, deny-list, and personal exclude filters. TrueCar skipped (body-style filter broken). <strong>No confirmed manual transmissions</strong> across all sources this refresh \u2014 manual10 is empty. The 2012 Ford Mustang GT (Broomall, private seller) has null transmission \u2014 could be a 6-speed; call before visiting. Image coverage: Cars.com 100% (all real URLs recovered from SRP), CarGurus 100%, AutoTrader 100%.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2011,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "S5",
        "trim": "3.0 Premium Plus Cabriolet",
        "price": 13642,
        "mileage": 69156,
        "location": "Haddon Township, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 17,
        "dealer": "Royal Auto Group",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/dabcb463-e945-41fc-b07c-dd08637d350a/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/220992f4-6d7b-5a84-999a-0c3c413cdc94/564cee7d-5505-4712-8a54-7f364740f431/TWUJbSHF9Ip8hGWCmQukBmMLH-E.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The B8 S5 Cabriolet packs a supercharged 3.0L V6 (333 hp), AWD quattro, and genuine 4-seat GT style. At 69k miles this is the youngest, lowest-mileage performance pick in the pool \u2014 most S5 Cabs surface at 100k+. Premium Plus trim means full sport package, Bang & Olufsen sound, ventilated seats. The S5 Cabriolet is a genuinely special car that draws looks everywhere.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full convertible-top cycle both directions \u2014 check hydraulic rams, header seal, rear-quarter zip window. Rear-seat headliner and carpet for water stains. Supercharger nose-cone bearing (whine at idle/off-throttle is the telltale). Timing chain tensioners (N63/3.0T era). Oil consumption check (1 qt/1000 mi is a red flag). Rocker panels for rust. Audi electrics: MMI operation, all windows and mirrors.",
        "bottomLine": "Best fun-to-value ratio in this entire pool \u2014 fast, all-season, gorgeous, and only 69k miles."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 1995,
        "make": "Jaguar",
        "model": "XJS",
        "trim": "4.0 Convertible",
        "price": 8750,
        "mileage": 46103,
        "location": "Magnolia, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 21,
        "dealer": "Avi Auto Sales",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/724093944",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/1ba65ae2c7a44bdfb45af6c3381358c3.jpg",
        "whyGood": "A 1995 XJS 4.0 Convertible with 46,103 miles is extraordinary \u2014 this car spent most of its 31 years barely moving. The 4.0L AJ16 inline-six is the most reliable XJS engine ever built, far better than the V12. 2+2 rear seats are confirmed. Great Deal rating at just $8,750. At this price you're buying decades of unused life.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full soft-top operation \u2014 Jaguar hood motors are a known weak point (listen for grinding, check for slow travel). Rear-window delamination or cracks. Coolant system (hoses, thermostat, radiator \u2014 XJS runs hot). British electrics: cruise, windows, AC, all gauges. Rocker sills for rust. No oil leaks from cam covers or sump.",
        "bottomLine": "46k miles on an XJS is almost unheard of \u2014 the most miles-per-dollar in this entire search."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2001,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK-Class",
        "trim": "Cabriolet",
        "price": 12940,
        "mileage": 34866,
        "location": "Willow Grove, PA",
        "distanceMi": 18,
        "dealer": "Selden Motors",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/618db3d8-7315-4e33-a78a-7051f0d06591/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/41500c3b-0278-565b-b8aa-8a53ec151e79/b6a20b1a-33b2-4e54-8623-a2400db3503e/KKA8lQVqFTelfR3UEOoMD48kSOU.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The W208 CLK Cabriolet at 34,866 miles is one of the lowest-mileage finds in this entire search. Mercedes build quality from this era is excellent \u2014 the W208 is mechanically simpler than later models with less electronic complexity. A 4-seat drop-top with elegant styling that still looks current. This generation has almost no major reliability red flags.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full convertible-top cycle \u2014 W208 top motors slow with age even at low mileage; rubber seals dry-rot regardless of miles. Rear-quarter seams for moisture. Engine bay rubber hose cracking. Rocker rust (PA salt roads). All electrics: windows, SRS light, ABS. Oil leaks from valve cover gaskets (common on M112 V6).",
        "bottomLine": "34k miles on a 25-year-old Mercedes is genuinely rare \u2014 buy condition, not clock age."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2009,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK",
        "trim": "350 Cabriolet",
        "price": 11470,
        "mileage": 65450,
        "location": "Media, PA",
        "distanceMi": 2,
        "dealer": "Prime Autohaus",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/453249815",
        "dealRating": "Fair Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/07/12/06/37/2009_mercedes-benz_clk-pic-1253254648819889813-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "The W209 CLK350 Cabriolet is the sweet spot of the CLK line \u2014 268hp 3.5L V6, proven reliability, and the last CLK before MB switched to the E-Class Cabriolet. 65k miles is very reasonable. Only 2 miles from Media \u2014 can't get closer. The last W209 CLK (2009) has the updated interior and electrics.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle \u2014 W209 hydraulic rams can weep. Rear-window seam condition. Rocker rust. Balance-shaft sprocket on the 3.5L (rattle if oil changes skipped \u2014 ask for records). All windows, AC compressor engagement, interior sun damage on dash and leather.",
        "bottomLine": "Local Media find, solid V6, right mileage for the money \u2014 most convenient pick in the search."
      },
      {
        "rank": 5,
        "year": 2004,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK 500",
        "trim": "Cabriolet",
        "price": 7900,
        "mileage": 82200,
        "location": "Waterford Works, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 32,
        "dealer": "Private Seller Exchange",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/788479418",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://assets.cai-media-management.com/ps-vehicle-media/691652ff-2b5f-401b-89c6-0ffd9a0ba397.png",
        "whyGood": "The CLK500 runs the 5.0L M113 V8 (302 hp) \u2014 one of the last naturally-aspirated V8 Cabriolets available for under $8k. 82k miles is genuinely low for a 21-year-old car. Private seller means room to negotiate. The M113 is one of the most reliable V8s Mercedes ever built.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top operation and hydraulic ram check. M113 V8 oil leaks (cam covers and valley pan). Coolant system. Confirm suspension type \u2014 avoid AIRMATIC if present (expensive to repair). Rocker rust critical. Private seller: insist on a full PPI at an independent Mercedes shop before committing.",
        "bottomLine": "V8 Cabriolet for under $8k \u2014 no-brainer if the top works and rockers are clean."
      },
      {
        "rank": 6,
        "year": 2017,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T quattro Premium Cabriolet AWD",
        "price": 13878,
        "mileage": 88594,
        "location": "Wynnewood, PA",
        "distanceMi": 10,
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cargurus",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/454248442",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/11/04/00/2017_audi_a3-pic-2432068867839100165-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "The 8V A3 Cabriolet is the most modern car in this pool \u2014 2017 means Apple CarPlay, modern safety tech, and the proven 2.0T EA888 engine. AWD quattro for year-round use. Good Deal rating. 88k miles on a 2017 is perfectly reasonable. 10 miles away in Wynnewood.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top fabric condition \u2014 look for tears near rear corners and header seal. Rear-window seam and headliner for moisture. S-tronic DSG transmission fluid service history. Water pump (EA888 known weak point around 90k). All electronics including virtual cockpit and MMI.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern, most livable daily-driver drop-top in the search \u2014 buy it and drive it."
      },
      {
        "rank": 7,
        "year": 2010,
        "make": "Lexus",
        "model": "IS 250C",
        "trim": "Base",
        "price": 12900,
        "mileage": 124762,
        "location": "Norristown, PA",
        "distanceMi": 14,
        "dealer": "New Concept Inc",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/f7d54151-c2eb-4bbb-a4f7-710d3cfe2836/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/large/in/v2/5631252c-0139-5d87-8647-26d44957f0e7/d35e8904-3dc0-469b-9e8f-e5091f2e12a4/VOyBnZtgK6xfBPE7yxnVu8esqFs.jpg",
        "whyGood": "The IS 250C is the most bulletproof convertible in this price bracket \u2014 Lexus powertrain reliability is legendary. The retractable hardtop means no fabric to rot or leak. 4 seats, premium interior, and the kind of reliability record German cars simply can't match. 124k on a Lexus is barely broken in.",
        "whatToVerify": "Retractable hardtop full cycle \u2014 listen for motor strain and check trunk seals. This is the single most important test: cycle it 5 times. IS 250 throttle carbon buildup (common on direct-injection engines \u2014 check for rough idle). Roof operation switch integrity. AC cold, heat hot \u2014 Lexus electrics are robust.",
        "bottomLine": "Most reliable pick in the search \u2014 the Lexus powertrain will outlast every other car here."
      },
      {
        "rank": 8,
        "year": 2016,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A5",
        "trim": "2.0T quattro Premium Cabriolet AWD",
        "price": 11480,
        "mileage": 111747,
        "location": "Feasterville Trevose, PA",
        "distanceMi": 27,
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cargurus",
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/455895318",
        "dealRating": "Good Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/19/16/15/2016_audi_a5-pic-8289068924660940898-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "The B8.5 A5 Cabriolet (2016 facelift) is a beautiful, capable 4-seat drop-top. AWD quattro, 2.0T engine, Good Deal rating. The 2016 refresh addressed most of the early B8's rough edges. At $11,480 this is well-priced for a relatively late A5 Cabriolet.",
        "whatToVerify": "Top fabric seams \u2014 rear corners split first on A5 Cabs. Roof drain channels (clog = water in trunk \u2014 check the corners). Timing chain tensioner (B8 2.0T). Oil leaks. S-tronic fluid service history. Rocker rust. Audi MMI electronics and all driver-assist features.",
        "bottomLine": "Good Deal rated, AWD, handsome \u2014 solid all-rounder if the top seams and drains check out."
      },
      {
        "rank": 9,
        "year": 2020,
        "make": "Ford",
        "model": "Mustang",
        "trim": "EcoBoost Premium Convertible",
        "price": 12995,
        "mileage": 132770,
        "location": "Langhorne, PA",
        "distanceMi": 33,
        "dealer": "Fred Beans Ford of Langhorne",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/786146269",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.autotrader.com/hn/c/090110e140f040e4bbe2ecc5adefbf4f.jpg",
        "whyGood": "Newest car in the entire pool by 3 years \u2014 2020 S550 Mustang with premium convertible trim, CarPlay, digital dash, modern safety. Great Deal rating. EcoBoost 2.3T makes 310 hp, respectable for a fun second car. Fred Beans is a reputable large dealer. 132k on a modern Mustang is high but the EcoBoost engine is robust.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full top cycle. Rear-window and header seal \u2014 check rear-seat carpet and headliner for water stains. S550 known issue: water pools in the folded-top pocket if the drain plug is missing \u2014 check it. MT-82 if manual, or 10-speed auto shift quality. Rear camera function. Pull Carfax for prior fleet/rental use.",
        "bottomLine": "Most modern Mustang in budget at a Great Deal \u2014 newest tech in the pool."
      },
      {
        "rank": 10,
        "year": 2015,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "435i xDrive",
        "trim": "Convertible AWD",
        "price": 8500,
        "mileage": 140389,
        "location": "Marlton, NJ",
        "distanceMi": 27,
        "dealer": "Private Seller Exchange",
        "source": "autotrader",
        "url": "https://www.autotrader.com/cars-for-sale/vehicle/754834213",
        "dealRating": null,
        "transmission": "Automatic",
